  "details": "I think there's a report for that already, but I couldn't find one that would have a tracked flair on it, so I'm making a new one.\n\nCurrently vrc+ gives ability to set custom pfp and banner instead of showing avatars preview as a banner. \n\nAfter you set up the banner, there's no way to remove it to make the banner appear as avatar preview anymore, besides deleting the picture that was set as banner, which is quite uncomfortable and unobvious\n\nIf possible, it'd be nice to have a button to reset it back to avatar preview, not necessarily on the client, but maybe at least on the website, so there's some way to do this without waiting for vrc+ to run out or deleting the picture you uploaded or took.",
